  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {他動詞|たどうし} (transitive). Compound verb: {切|き}る + {詰|つ}める.\n\nPATTERN: Xを{切|き}り{詰|つ}める (cut back on X / trim X)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n・{生活|せいかつ}を{切|き}り{詰|つ}める (economize on lifestyle)\n・{予算|よさん}を{切|き}り{詰|つ}める (cut the budget)\n・{費用|ひよう}を{切|き}り{詰|つ}める (reduce costs)\n・{切|き}り{詰|つ}めた{生活|せいかつ} (frugal lifestyle)\n\nSIMILAR WORDS:\n・{節約|せつやく}する: To economize (neutral, general)\n・{切|き}り{詰|つ}める: To cut back (implies sacrifice, doing without)\n・けちる: To skimp (casual, slightly negative)",
